WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:47.115
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:47.385 --> 01:50.545
What are you guys doing?

3
01:50.625 --> 01:54.065
Stand there and answer our questions honestly.

4
01:54.145 --> 01:55.385
Did you have fun today?

5
01:58.865 --> 02:00.425
The one who can make you happy

6
02:00.505 --> 02:02.265
is the right one.

7
02:03.105 --> 02:05.385
Wait, what's that light for?

8
02:05.465 --> 02:07.625
I'm lighting it up for Chen Yanzhou.

9
02:07.705 --> 02:10.265
Did Chen Yanzhou walk you back to the dorm?

10
02:11.185 --> 02:13.385
Did he walk you to the door?

11
02:15.145 --> 02:16.185
How considerate!

12
02:16.265 --> 02:17.985
I'm lighting it up for him too!

13
02:19.265 --> 02:21.185
Did he say any sweet words to you?

14
02:21.265 --> 02:22.865
Being considerate isn't enough.

15
02:22.945 --> 02:24.105
He needs to express it.

16
02:26.145 --> 02:28.105
Zheng Yu, I like you.

17
02:30.785 --> 02:32.025
I get it.

18
02:32.105 --> 02:34.145
I also give Chen Yanzhou the light.

19
02:34.825 --> 02:37.185
So he has passed.

20
02:37.825 --> 02:39.225
Wait.

21
02:39.305 --> 02:40.345
One more question.

22
02:41.065 --> 02:42.025
Have you two

23
02:42.825 --> 02:44.345
kissed?

24
02:44.985 --> 02:46.825
Of course not. What are you thinking?

25
02:49.145 --> 02:50.025
We were too hasty.

26
02:50.985 --> 02:52.865
Break it up.

27
02:54.025 --> 02:55.265
Let's go to bed.

28
02:55.865 --> 02:58.065
No fun!

29
02:58.145 --> 03:01.105
Instead of buying tickets to go home after your exams,

30
03:01.185 --> 03:02.625
you stayed to poke fun at me?

31
03:02.705 --> 03:05.025
Are we poking fun at you?

32
03:05.105 --> 03:06.425
We're looking out for you.

33
03:06.505 --> 03:08.185
Looking out for you. Got it?

34
03:08.265 --> 03:10.225
-Exactly. -You haven't dated before.

35
03:10.305 --> 03:12.145
You're in the pre-dating stage.

36
03:12.225 --> 03:13.985
We have to give you some advice.

37
03:14.905 --> 03:15.865
Have you dated?

38
03:15.945 --> 03:18.425
I haven't done it, but I know how it works.

39
03:19.705 --> 03:22.825
How is it the pre-dating stage?

40
03:22.905 --> 03:24.745
How isn't it pre-dating?

41
03:24.825 --> 03:26.185
Isn't it obvious?

42
03:26.265 --> 03:28.185
I thought you were dating already.

43
03:28.265 --> 03:30.465
No kiss means pre-dating.

44
03:30.545 --> 03:31.505
That's right.

45
03:31.585 --> 03:34.065
I'm deeply disappointed with this progress.

46
03:34.145 --> 03:35.385
The light isn't deserved.

47
03:38.505 --> 03:40.585
The lights went out.

48
03:40.665 --> 03:42.305
See?

49
03:42.385 --> 03:46.145
Even those above turned off the lights. Heaven is disappointed.

50
03:48.025 --> 03:49.185
No way.

51
03:49.265 --> 03:50.865
Calling so soon after parting?

52
03:50.945 --> 03:52.185
Rookies.

53
03:52.265 --> 03:54.825
Will we see progress before we go home?

54
03:54.905 --> 03:57.425
DR. ZHAO

55
04:01.865 --> 04:02.945
Hello?

56
04:04.025 --> 04:08.145
The patient suffered from a blood clot that blocked the main artery in the lungs,

57
04:08.225 --> 04:09.705
obstructing blood flow.

58
04:09.785 --> 04:11.705
We are doing our best to save her.

59
04:11.785 --> 04:14.825
But the situation isn't optimistic.

60
04:14.905 --> 04:16.545
I have to return to surgery.

61
04:16.624 --> 04:19.504
Zheng Yu, you should prepare for the worst.

62
04:53.985 --> 04:55.185
Xiaomian.

63
05:15.385 --> 05:16.745
Zheng Yu,

64
05:16.825 --> 05:18.385
why don't you sleep for a bit?

65
05:18.465 --> 05:20.025
You need to rest.

66
05:21.025 --> 05:22.065
Don't worry about me.

67
05:22.705 --> 05:23.865
Go to sleep.

68
05:24.465 --> 05:25.625
Zheng Yu,

69
05:25.705 --> 05:29.545
we'll go back to the hospital with you to complete the procedures later.

70
05:30.425 --> 05:33.345
No need. I can manage on my own.

71
05:33.945 --> 05:35.145
Zheng Yu,

72
05:36.425 --> 05:40.145
if you want to cry, then cry.

73
05:40.745 --> 05:42.305
We're worried about you.

74
05:50.025 --> 05:50.945
Thank you.

75
05:51.025 --> 05:52.225
I really am fine.

76
05:52.305 --> 05:53.545
Don't worry about me.

77
06:26.025 --> 06:27.265
Why did you call me here?

78
06:27.345 --> 06:29.505
Shouldn't you be off work at this hour?

79
06:29.585 --> 06:31.825
The workday is over in China,

80
06:31.905 --> 06:33.945
but it's just starting abroad.

81
06:35.265 --> 06:36.545
What do you mean?

82
06:39.945 --> 06:41.785
You were dragging your feet.

83
06:41.865 --> 06:43.665
The application deadline was near,

84
06:43.745 --> 06:45.385
so I got your transcripts

85
06:45.465 --> 06:47.225
and submitted your application.

86
06:47.305 --> 06:49.905
I hadn't heard back. I thought there was no chance.

87
06:50.505 --> 06:51.825
What a nice surprise.

88
06:51.905 --> 06:55.665
By the way, Professor Cheng wrote your recommendation letter.

89
06:55.745 --> 07:00.225
When she heard you were interested in applying to do research on cancer cells,

90
07:00.305 --> 07:01.705
she was very happy for you.

91
07:01.785 --> 07:03.185
I'm not interested.

92
07:05.305 --> 07:06.385
What I mean is,

93
07:07.145 --> 07:09.105
I can do research in this area

94
07:09.185 --> 07:11.425
even if I don't go to this research institute.

95
07:11.505 --> 07:12.985
It's just a matter of time.

96
07:14.465 --> 07:16.545
Well, why waste time?

97
07:20.065 --> 07:20.945
Put this aside.

98
07:21.025 --> 07:22.625
Prepare for the interview first.

99
07:22.705 --> 07:25.745
If you don't pass, then that's the end of it.

100
07:25.825 --> 07:27.225
I still…

101
07:27.785 --> 07:29.025
Don't let Zheng Yu down.

102
07:29.105 --> 07:31.705
I told her I would submit your application for you.

103
07:31.785 --> 07:35.785
After she heard, she immediately looked into the relevant research.

104
07:36.625 --> 07:38.025
Zheng Yu?

105
07:38.105 --> 07:39.265
She knew about this?

106
07:40.265 --> 07:42.145
You two are in the same research team.

107
07:42.905 --> 07:46.105
She even gave me materials related to your research

108
07:46.185 --> 07:47.785
to add to your resume.

109
07:51.745 --> 07:53.745
Don't forget about the interview!

110
07:53.825 --> 07:54.945
ZHENG YU

111
07:55.025 --> 07:57.305
Where are you? Let's meet up.

112
08:02.985 --> 08:05.905
CHEN YANZHOU: WHERE ARE YOU? LET'S MEET UP.

113
08:11.665 --> 08:12.705
Is she that busy?

114
08:12.785 --> 08:14.905
Finals just ended.

115
08:16.305 --> 08:17.945
Did she get a new part-time job?

116
08:21.745 --> 08:23.465
ZHENG YU

117
08:34.345 --> 08:35.625
ZHUANG NING

118
08:40.185 --> 08:41.865
Hello, Zhuang Ning.

119
08:41.945 --> 08:43.505
Is Zheng Yu at the dorm?

120
09:53.585 --> 09:54.825
Zheng Yu!

121
11:06.025 --> 11:07.505
I should have come sooner.

122
11:10.625 --> 11:12.265
Today

123
11:12.945 --> 11:14.265
was so busy.

124
11:15.545 --> 11:18.345
Even if you had come, I wouldn't have had time for you.

125
11:21.705 --> 11:23.905
Ever since my mom's accident,

126
11:24.625 --> 11:26.905
I've felt quite down on my luck.

127
11:29.145 --> 11:31.665
But at least I had a goal.

128
11:32.825 --> 11:35.585
I hoped she could live a little longer.

129
11:39.145 --> 11:40.665
As long as she was alive,

130
11:41.785 --> 11:43.545
there was still hope.

131
11:46.385 --> 11:48.425
But now my mom is gone.

132
11:51.385 --> 11:52.745
My goal is gone.

133
11:55.745 --> 11:57.265
Hope is gone too.

134
12:53.465 --> 12:55.545
Chen Yanzhou asked me to bring these in.

135
13:01.705 --> 13:02.625
Thank you.

136
13:15.865 --> 13:16.985
CHEN YANZHOU

137
13:17.065 --> 13:18.665
I bought some food for you.

138
13:18.745 --> 13:20.785
I asked Zhuang Ning to bring it in.

139
13:20.865 --> 13:24.185
Even if you don't have an appetite, fill your stomach first.

140
13:24.265 --> 13:27.025
Also, if you can't sleep at night,

141
13:27.105 --> 13:28.625
you can text me.

142
13:28.705 --> 13:30.425
My phone won't be on silent.

143
13:46.625 --> 13:49.425
That's it? How long will it take you to pay off the debt?

144
13:50.945 --> 13:54.025
Even senior high students are trying to play the hero.

145
13:54.105 --> 13:56.305
You have some nerve coming with chump change.

146
13:57.145 --> 14:01.385
I'll find a way to get money. Don't bother my sister for a while.

147
14:01.985 --> 14:05.145
What? You owe money and want to observe a mourning period?

148
14:05.945 --> 14:07.065
Listen,

149
14:07.145 --> 14:08.825
debt collectors don't care!

150
14:18.945 --> 14:20.585
Look at you.

151
14:20.665 --> 14:22.425
Your sister can take more than you.

152
14:22.505 --> 14:24.985
Just a few words, and you're already so pissed.

153
14:27.745 --> 14:28.585
Listen.

154
14:28.665 --> 14:32.345
If you really want to help your sister, get money from your uncle.

155
14:32.425 --> 14:34.105
That's better than a summer job.

156
14:34.705 --> 14:37.145
Will you stay away from my sister then?

157
14:37.905 --> 14:38.825
I'll consider it.

158
14:43.025 --> 14:44.785
Speak of the devil.

159
14:51.185 --> 14:53.185
If you don't want me at your dorm,

160
14:53.265 --> 14:55.705
then you had better come right now!

161
15:04.305 --> 15:05.825
I called you here today

162
15:06.465 --> 15:09.225
to make things clear to you.

163
15:09.305 --> 15:10.985
Your mom is dead.

164
15:11.825 --> 15:15.385
For you and for me, it's a good thing.

165
15:16.185 --> 15:19.185
For you, it's a burden off your shoulders.

166
15:19.265 --> 15:21.705
For me, I feel settled now.

167
15:22.465 --> 15:25.345
Starting today, Jiang Mian is my son.

168
15:25.425 --> 15:27.585
This is a fact set in stone now.

169
15:27.665 --> 15:29.945
Nobody can take him away.

170
15:31.585 --> 15:33.785
And what did I hear from Wu Liang?

171
15:33.865 --> 15:35.825
You got a rich boyfriend.

172
15:36.705 --> 15:38.465
As your uncle,

173
15:38.545 --> 15:41.465
I was quite happy for you after I heard this.

174
15:41.545 --> 15:43.225
Here's my suggestion.

175
15:44.025 --> 15:46.825
Rein in your nasty temper.

176
15:47.585 --> 15:49.625
If you make him happy

177
15:49.705 --> 15:51.585
and tie him down,

178
15:51.665 --> 15:53.825
you'll get to live the good life, yeah?

179
15:56.465 --> 15:58.025
I'm talking to you.

180
16:03.065 --> 16:05.465
I want to ask you for a favor, Uncle.

181
16:08.025 --> 16:09.465
Can you lend me some money?

182
16:14.585 --> 16:17.745
The adjacent bed's family paid Mom's emergency treatment bill.

183
16:18.585 --> 16:20.345
I used all the money I have

184
16:20.425 --> 16:22.225
on Mom's funeral arrangements.

185
16:23.265 --> 16:25.225
The adjacent bed?

186
16:27.065 --> 16:28.705
I remember that woman.

187
16:29.705 --> 16:31.345
Her mom is also dying.

188
16:31.425 --> 16:33.665
She's just waiting there every day.

189
16:33.745 --> 16:34.985
Right?

190
16:36.825 --> 16:41.785
I have to repay her as soon as possible. Her mom is still sick.

191
16:41.865 --> 16:42.945
Wait, Zheng Yu.

192
16:43.025 --> 16:44.625
Are you kidding me?

193
16:45.225 --> 16:46.865
I say, listen to me.

194
16:46.945 --> 16:48.945
Not paying her back is helping her.

195
16:49.025 --> 16:50.985
What happens if you pay her back?

196
16:51.065 --> 16:52.985
The hospital profits in the end.

197
16:53.065 --> 16:55.825
In my opinion, she and you should get checked.

198
16:55.905 --> 16:57.905
You both are wrong in the head.

199
16:57.985 --> 17:00.265
What's this? You lay your mom to rest.

200
17:00.345 --> 17:01.945
-Now it's her turn? -Repeat that!

201
17:02.025 --> 17:03.785
What did you say about my sister?

202
17:03.865 --> 17:05.305
You're hitting me?

203
17:05.985 --> 17:06.985
Little brat!

204
17:07.065 --> 17:09.505
Do you have a conscience, hitting your dad?

205
17:10.424 --> 17:11.825
-Ungrateful boy! -Jiang Mian!

206
17:11.905 --> 17:13.944
-My dad is long dead! -Jiang Mian!

207
17:15.025 --> 17:16.345
Jiang Mian!

208
17:22.025 --> 17:23.585
I'm… I'm your dad.

209
17:24.825 --> 17:25.665
You hit me.

210
17:27.944 --> 17:29.185
Leave!

211
17:29.265 --> 17:30.505
You're free.

212
17:30.585 --> 17:32.505
Go wherever you want!

213
17:39.145 --> 17:40.425
Zheng Yu,

214
17:40.505 --> 17:41.865
go back to campus first.

215
17:41.945 --> 17:43.265
He just needs to cool off.

216
17:44.185 --> 17:45.665
He won't lend you money.

217
17:45.745 --> 17:46.865
Don't worry.

218
17:46.945 --> 17:48.505
I… I'll figure something out.

219
17:49.505 --> 17:52.265
Find some time to pack your things.

220
17:52.345 --> 17:53.545
Don't stay here anymore.

221
17:54.425 --> 17:57.425
What do you mean? I'll just apologize to him later.

222
18:00.905 --> 18:02.465
I'll call Ms. Sun.

223
18:02.545 --> 18:06.265
After school starts, you can live on campus.

224
18:06.345 --> 18:09.865
You'll be a third-year student. You can't continue on like this.

225
18:10.465 --> 18:11.785
No.

226
18:11.865 --> 18:14.425
Zheng Yu, one semester of boarding costs 2,000 yuan.

227
18:16.985 --> 18:18.945
JIANG HAIXING DIGITAL REPAIR

228
18:19.025 --> 18:20.625
Do as I say.

229
18:20.705 --> 18:21.985
I'll take care of it.

230
18:40.745 --> 18:41.865
Chen Yanzhou,

231
18:42.745 --> 18:46.305
Ms. Yang covered the bill for my mom's emergency treatment.

232
18:46.385 --> 18:48.225
Can you lend me…

233
19:06.625 --> 19:09.105
I want to borrow some money from you.

234
19:21.625 --> 19:23.105
YOU RECALLED A MESSAGE

235
19:25.345 --> 19:27.305
CHEN YANZHOU

236
19:30.305 --> 19:32.305
-Hello? -Did something happen?

237
19:34.065 --> 19:36.625
-No. -Then why did you recall the message?

238
19:38.905 --> 19:40.145
Where are you?

239
19:40.225 --> 19:41.745
I'll come find you.

240
19:41.825 --> 19:43.025
No.

241
19:46.985 --> 19:50.185
Okay. I have something to give you anyway.

242
20:16.625 --> 20:20.425
There's a research institute in Germany working on a cancer cell research project.

243
20:20.505 --> 20:23.905
They've opened internship positions to college students worldwide.

244
20:23.985 --> 20:26.305
I think he should give it a try.

245
20:27.705 --> 20:29.505
He's still young

246
20:29.585 --> 20:31.785
and doesn't know that he has other options.

247
20:34.585 --> 20:36.105
You can't go abroad with him.

248
20:36.865 --> 20:38.305
Would he stay for you?

249
20:38.985 --> 20:41.345
Or do you plan to have him pay

250
20:41.425 --> 20:43.025
for you to go with him?

251
20:45.145 --> 20:46.985
And what did I hear from Wu Liang?

252
20:47.065 --> 20:49.025
You got a rich boyfriend.

253
20:49.105 --> 20:50.425
Here's my suggestion.

254
20:50.505 --> 20:53.745
Rein in your nasty temper.

255
20:53.825 --> 20:54.985
If you make him happy

256
20:55.785 --> 20:57.865
and tie him down,

257
20:57.945 --> 21:00.225
you'll get to live the good life, yeah?

258
21:02.625 --> 21:03.465
Zheng Yu.

259
21:06.385 --> 21:07.265
Spacing out?

260
21:09.305 --> 21:10.145
It's nothing.

261
21:16.825 --> 21:19.185
You have something to give me. What is it?

262
21:24.625 --> 21:26.785
This is information on the Haeckel Institute

263
21:26.865 --> 21:29.185
and a few of the professors' research projects.

264
21:29.265 --> 21:31.545
I asked an alumna to help put this together.

265
21:31.625 --> 21:34.745
It should be useful for your interview.

266
21:36.945 --> 21:38.505
I'm not going to the interview.

267
21:39.505 --> 21:42.825
I didn't know that Li Yanan had submitted an application.

268
21:44.745 --> 21:46.065
I know.

269
21:47.665 --> 21:49.505
Then why are you giving me this?

270
21:58.225 --> 21:59.425
Do you know something?

271
22:00.145 --> 22:03.265
My mom spent her life living for others.

272
22:04.705 --> 22:05.985
For my dad,

273
22:06.065 --> 22:07.185
for me,

274
22:07.265 --> 22:08.305
and for my brother.

275
22:09.585 --> 22:10.865
And for my uncle.

276
22:12.545 --> 22:15.105
Back then, she always used to say to me,

277
22:15.185 --> 22:18.265
"Xiaoyu, don't be like me."

278
22:20.185 --> 22:22.625
I didn't understand what she meant at the time.

279
22:23.665 --> 22:26.345
I thought she just didn't want me to suffer.

280
22:27.745 --> 22:29.145
Later, I understood.

281
22:29.985 --> 22:31.505
She wanted to tell me…

282
22:34.025 --> 22:38.145
not to sacrifice who I can become for anyone else's sake.

283
22:41.385 --> 22:45.665
The series of unexpected situations that have occurred recently

284
22:46.345 --> 22:47.665
brought me clarity.

285
22:49.785 --> 22:51.785
Right now,

286
22:51.865 --> 22:55.385
I don't have the right to think about anything other than surviving.

287
22:58.145 --> 22:59.265
What lies ahead

288
22:59.865 --> 23:01.985
is a pile of problems that I need to solve.

289
23:03.145 --> 23:04.185
My brother.

290
23:04.265 --> 23:05.625
My studies.

291
23:05.705 --> 23:06.945
Debt.

292
23:10.385 --> 23:14.105
I truly can't take on

293
23:14.705 --> 23:16.905
the burden of another person's future.

294
23:18.785 --> 23:20.185
So

295
23:21.145 --> 23:22.865
you have to pass the interview.

296
23:34.265 --> 23:35.505
Chen Yanzhou,

297
23:36.345 --> 23:39.465
let's not plan detours for anyone

298
23:39.545 --> 23:42.385
or make sacrifices for anyone.

299
23:42.465 --> 23:45.665
Let's each keep going in the direction we're meant to go.

300
23:49.865 --> 23:50.985
All right.

301
23:52.185 --> 23:53.305
But Zheng Yu?

302
23:55.425 --> 23:57.585
The fact that I like you

303
23:57.665 --> 24:01.585
has nothing to do with whether you have troubles

304
24:01.665 --> 24:02.825
or whether I stay.

305
24:04.265 --> 24:06.065
I told you before.

306
24:06.145 --> 24:08.265
I'm not looking for an answer.

307
24:11.385 --> 24:14.425
As long as you need me, I'll be here.

308
26:32.305 --> 26:33.545
Mom.

309
26:46.745 --> 26:48.345
When you were 14,

310
26:48.425 --> 26:51.425
I gave this umbrella to you.

311
26:52.185 --> 26:53.305
You still have it.

312
26:54.425 --> 26:55.625
Of course.

313
26:55.705 --> 27:00.025
You said it could shield me from rain and stay with me for a long time.

314
27:03.985 --> 27:05.625
Mom,

315
27:05.705 --> 27:06.545
you can walk now.

316
27:09.545 --> 27:10.505
So

317
27:11.625 --> 27:12.945
this is a dream.

318
27:20.185 --> 27:21.225
Mom.

319
27:22.785 --> 27:25.225
Ever since you fell ill,

320
27:25.305 --> 27:27.345
you haven't visited me.

321
27:28.665 --> 27:30.105
How come you came today?

322
27:32.785 --> 27:34.945
I came to tell you

323
27:36.305 --> 27:39.945
that although the umbrella can shield you from the rain,

324
27:40.745 --> 27:41.945
you still

325
27:42.985 --> 27:44.545
have to walk your own path.

326
27:48.905 --> 27:50.665
I understand.

327
27:50.745 --> 27:53.385
Ever since you became sick,

328
27:53.465 --> 27:54.985
I have walked by myself.

329
27:58.625 --> 28:00.705
I mean a longer

330
28:01.705 --> 28:02.825
and farther path.

331
28:12.345 --> 28:13.705
Xiaoyu,

332
28:14.425 --> 28:15.945
many such moments

333
28:17.065 --> 28:18.425
will occur from now on.

334
28:20.025 --> 28:21.265
But remember.

335
28:22.905 --> 28:24.585
Even if you are alone,

336
28:25.305 --> 28:26.225
don't be afraid.

337
28:28.185 --> 28:29.305
Keep moving forward.

338
28:30.665 --> 28:31.865
The sky

339
28:32.745 --> 28:33.665
will clear up.

340
29:02.745 --> 29:03.665
Mom, look!

341
29:20.905 --> 29:21.865
Mom.

342
29:35.025 --> 29:36.185
Mom!

343
30:01.385 --> 30:02.465
Mom.

344
30:34.105 --> 30:34.945
Hello?

345
30:36.225 --> 30:37.305
Today?

346
30:38.625 --> 30:39.825
Okay, I see.

347
30:50.505 --> 30:52.705
Zheng Yu, you're up.

348
30:52.785 --> 30:53.985
Eat some breakfast.

349
30:55.665 --> 30:57.825
I just got a call from an upperclassman.

350
30:57.905 --> 30:59.945
They need a part-timer. I have to go.

351
31:00.545 --> 31:02.625
Go on. We'll wait for you to return.

352
31:04.225 --> 31:06.305
I'll be working until curfew.

353
31:06.385 --> 31:08.305
We'll keep an eye on the door.

354
31:08.385 --> 31:10.065
We won't let them lock you out.

355
31:11.345 --> 31:14.265
I meant that you should go home.

356
31:14.345 --> 31:16.385
I'm fine.

357
31:16.465 --> 31:17.665
I'll be very busy soon.

358
31:17.745 --> 31:20.145
Even if you stay,

359
31:20.225 --> 31:21.945
you might not see me much.

360
31:25.065 --> 31:26.025
Then…

361
31:26.945 --> 31:28.385
Okay.

362
31:28.465 --> 31:30.145
Text us if you need anything.

363
31:30.225 --> 31:31.665
Or call us.

364
32:48.345 --> 32:50.665
The break ended too soon.

365
32:50.745 --> 32:52.265
It felt long to me.

366
32:53.225 --> 32:57.505
Someone like you who applied to be in prison wouldn't understand.

367
32:57.585 --> 32:59.785
-Prison? -Yes.

368
32:59.865 --> 33:02.065
How is boarding any different from prison?

369
33:02.145 --> 33:03.225
What's bad about prison?

370
33:03.305 --> 33:05.105
What kind of blasphemy is that?

371
33:05.185 --> 33:07.305
Don't let a police officer hear that.

372
33:07.905 --> 33:10.745
Compared to living under the same roof as someone I hate,

373
33:11.505 --> 33:13.065
I'd prefer solitary confinement.

374
33:13.145 --> 33:16.225
Besides, how is school considered a prison?

375
33:16.305 --> 33:18.945
School is the best place for me.

376
33:19.025 --> 33:21.385
How did you escape from the dragon's clutches

377
33:21.465 --> 33:22.905
and sneak these treasures out?

378
33:22.985 --> 33:24.545
He likes to drink.

379
33:24.625 --> 33:26.785
When he's drunk, nothing can wake him up.

380
33:26.865 --> 33:29.345
-That's it? -What did you expect?

381
33:29.425 --> 33:30.905
I thought you two went at it,

382
33:30.985 --> 33:32.945
and you knocked him out cold.

383
33:33.905 --> 33:35.905
Don't let a police officer hear that.

384
33:38.265 --> 33:40.865
Has my sister contacted you lately?

385
33:40.945 --> 33:45.225
No, Ms. Zheng hasn't come over to my house in a long time.

386
33:45.305 --> 33:49.105
I think her advisor told her to go on a work trip out of town.

387
33:49.185 --> 33:51.225
Her whole group went.

388
33:51.305 --> 33:53.225
Yanzhou was supposed to go too,

389
33:53.305 --> 33:55.145
but he went abroad.

390
33:58.465 --> 34:01.545
In the past, when Chen Huimei was busy,

391
34:01.625 --> 34:03.745
at least I had Yanzhou and Ms. Zheng around.

392
34:04.465 --> 34:05.465
Now great.

393
34:05.545 --> 34:06.825
They're both gone.

394
34:06.905 --> 34:09.585
When they get even busier, who will hang out with me?

395
34:13.304 --> 34:16.905
Why don't I also apply for boarding this semester?

396
34:17.665 --> 34:19.025
Why are you asking me?

397
34:19.105 --> 34:21.145
You should ask Chen Huimei.

398
34:21.225 --> 34:23.344
Why are you calling my mom by her full name?

399
34:23.425 --> 34:25.065
You infected me.

400
34:25.145 --> 34:27.425
Infect? Am I some kind of virus?

401
34:27.505 --> 34:28.985
Don't pick a fight.

402
34:30.545 --> 34:33.344
Why do you have so many waxberries in your suitcase?

403
34:33.425 --> 34:34.344
Do you like them?

404
34:34.425 --> 34:35.945
You can have them all.

405
34:36.025 --> 34:38.344
Finally, something nice from you.

406
34:54.425 --> 34:55.385
Chen Yanzhou.

407
34:57.945 --> 34:59.985
You're here? I thought you couldn't make it.

408
35:00.985 --> 35:03.145
I asked Professor Qiu for a half-day off.

409
35:03.985 --> 35:05.025
Are you heading out?

410
35:06.105 --> 35:07.505
My flight is at 3:00 p.m.

411
35:08.345 --> 35:10.945
I can't go with you to the airport.

412
35:12.745 --> 35:14.105
You're already seeing me off.

413
35:17.465 --> 35:19.945
We won't be able to see each other for a long time.

414
35:20.745 --> 35:22.385
I will miss you.

415
35:22.465 --> 35:25.145
Will you miss me?

416
35:32.625 --> 35:34.785
I mean as a friend.

417
35:37.745 --> 35:38.585
I will.

418
35:41.705 --> 35:43.745
Contact me if anything happens.

419
35:47.825 --> 35:49.145
And when nothing's happening.

420
35:55.025 --> 35:56.665
You'll be busy in the coming year.

421
35:57.385 --> 36:00.185
I'll try to message you less and not bother you too much.

422
36:01.025 --> 36:03.305
Why don't I email you?

423
36:03.385 --> 36:04.825
Reply if you want, or not.

424
36:07.025 --> 36:09.425
Yanzhou, come take a look.

425
36:09.505 --> 36:11.025
Are you bringing these?

426
36:11.945 --> 36:13.145
Coming!

427
36:13.225 --> 36:15.105
Hurry up. We have to go soon.

428
36:16.465 --> 36:17.985
You should bring this too.

429
36:19.065 --> 36:21.105
You're going to be running late.

430
36:21.185 --> 36:22.945
I'll be going, then.

431
36:23.745 --> 36:25.145
Safe travels.

432
36:26.465 --> 36:27.465
Zheng Yu.

433
36:31.985 --> 36:33.345
As a farewell…

434
36:35.385 --> 36:36.425
how about a hug?

435
36:49.425 --> 36:51.785
Chen Yanzhou, I wish you all the best.

436
37:07.185 --> 37:08.145
Take care of yourself.

437
37:35.785 --> 37:36.745
MS. YANG 2,500 YUAN SENT

438
37:36.825 --> 37:38.265
Ms. Yang, I'm sorry

439
37:38.345 --> 37:39.905
for paying you so late.

440
37:39.985 --> 37:42.145
I will find a way to come up with the rest.

441
37:52.425 --> 37:54.825
Xiaomian already gave me the money.

442
37:54.905 --> 37:55.865
Didn't you know?

443
38:01.105 --> 38:03.185
Where did Xiaomian get so much money?

444
38:11.985 --> 38:14.025
Zheng Yu, you wanted to see me?

445
38:16.385 --> 38:19.185
-Have you adjusted to boarding? -It's pretty good.

446
38:19.905 --> 38:21.745
Has Jiang Haixing…?

447
38:21.825 --> 38:22.865
He came to campus once.

448
38:23.585 --> 38:25.985
After the teacher lectured him, he hasn't come back.

449
38:28.705 --> 38:31.665
Did you ask him for money?

450
38:32.465 --> 38:33.465
I didn't.

451
38:34.345 --> 38:37.145
Then where did you get the money to repay Ms. Yang?

452
38:42.705 --> 38:43.545
It was Yanzhou.

453
38:45.265 --> 38:47.305
He came to see me before going abroad.

454
38:48.185 --> 38:49.505
Chen Yanzhou?

455
38:54.745 --> 38:56.625
Take these waxberries and try them.

456
38:59.385 --> 39:01.945
I brought them to visit Ms. Yang just now.

457
39:02.025 --> 39:03.985
I accidentally brought too many.

458
39:04.065 --> 39:06.865
I don't have anyone to give them to, so you can have them.

459
39:07.585 --> 39:10.265
Did you ask to meet me just for this?

460
39:11.665 --> 39:12.665
No.

461
39:13.465 --> 39:14.465
I just sent you money.

462
39:15.185 --> 39:17.185
Use it to repay Ms. Yang.

463
39:21.545 --> 39:24.465
I only heard when I went to the hospital

464
39:24.545 --> 39:27.625
that Ms. Yang had covered your mom's emergency treatment bill.

465
39:28.585 --> 39:31.945
Your sister will feel bad about owing her for too long.

466
39:32.705 --> 39:36.065
Since you visited Ms. Yang, why didn't you give it to her directly?

467
39:36.945 --> 39:41.465
If I give it, Ms. Yang won't accept it because I'm in no position to do that.

468
39:42.225 --> 39:43.425
But you're different.

469
39:44.385 --> 39:45.305
Xiaomian,

470
39:45.945 --> 39:48.065
you're her brother, her family.

471
39:51.425 --> 39:54.265
If my sister finds out, what should I tell her?

472
40:00.625 --> 40:01.745
Give her this letter.

473
40:11.505 --> 40:14.185
I don't know when you will find out about this.

474
40:15.185 --> 40:17.505
If it's before I leave,

475
40:18.105 --> 40:20.985
I'm sure you will definitely come looking for me.

476
40:22.345 --> 40:23.345
I still remember that time.

477
40:24.385 --> 40:26.665
You insisted on returning 10,000 yuan to me.

478
40:27.505 --> 40:31.585
If you were to look at me like that again,

479
40:33.345 --> 40:35.305
I don't think I would be able to leave.

480
40:36.985 --> 40:39.105
That's why I wrote this letter.

481
40:41.385 --> 40:43.265
I earned this money myself.

482
40:43.905 --> 40:45.385
Don't forget,

483
40:45.465 --> 40:48.025
we used to be fierce rivals.

484
40:48.625 --> 40:50.065
Just like you,

485
40:50.145 --> 40:51.865
I've received several scholarships.

486
40:52.945 --> 40:54.665
Don't rush to pay me back.

487
40:54.745 --> 40:57.745
Consider this another collaboration.

488
40:59.185 --> 41:01.265
This year passed by too quickly.

489
41:01.905 --> 41:03.625
I never imagined

490
41:03.705 --> 41:06.345
my life would change so drastically

491
41:06.425 --> 41:08.505
because of one person I met.

492
41:09.025 --> 41:12.825
This period of time is a precious chapter in my life.

493
41:13.785 --> 41:15.865
It helped me rediscover myself.

494
41:16.825 --> 41:18.225
Therefore,

495
41:18.305 --> 41:21.905
it's only natural that I understand you too.

496
41:23.025 --> 41:26.985
So please accept this support without reservations.

497
41:27.505 --> 41:31.625
Just like how we once gave each other comfort,

498
41:31.705 --> 41:32.825
courage,

499
41:33.585 --> 41:34.985
and determination.

500
41:37.385 --> 41:38.465
Zheng Yu,

501
41:38.545 --> 41:42.145
as we each head in our own directions,

502
41:42.225 --> 41:44.385
I'll be rooting for you from afar.

503
41:44.465 --> 41:49.905
And I hope our reunions will always outnumber our farewells by one.

504
41:52.625 --> 41:53.705
If only

505
41:53.785 --> 41:55.625
Yanzhou hadn't gone abroad.

506
41:56.665 --> 41:57.985
Then you wouldn't be alone.

507
42:00.625 --> 42:04.105
Sometimes, your only wish for someone

508
42:04.185 --> 42:05.985
is for them to keep shining.

509
42:06.625 --> 42:09.465
Whether that ray of light shines on you

510
42:10.745 --> 42:12.105
isn't that important.

511
42:13.425 --> 42:15.905
You and Yanzhou said pretty much the same thing.

512
42:18.225 --> 42:19.345
Are you helping my sister

513
42:19.945 --> 42:22.425
because you want to pursue her?

514
42:27.305 --> 42:28.385
I just

515
42:29.185 --> 42:31.065
don't want to see her held back by this.

516
42:32.745 --> 42:35.025
She is someone who was meant to shine.

517
42:35.865 --> 42:39.345
Getting to see her do the things she wants to do

518
42:39.425 --> 42:40.745
is enough for me.
